AB  - Economic Denial of Sustainability (EDoS) attacks can cause cloud customers to pay for malicious resource consumption. The paper proposes a framework that learns normal and abnormal virtual-machine behavior and allocates extra resources only to VMs classified as normal, limiting attack propagation and resource misuse.
